@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Billing disputes
+
+The billing implementation defines a 30-day refund window through `refundWindowDays` in `/src/billing.ts`.
+
+Treat that window as the only established refund-policy fact. It does not establish refund eligibility, approval authority, refund amounts, payment status, or execution behavior. For invoice questions, no canonical policy or implementation behavior currently establishes adjustments, corrections, balances, or payment status.
+
+When a refund or invoice answer requires any unsupported fact, state the limitation and escalate the question rather than inferring policy or promising an outcome.

